WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.400
One more try.

00:01.520 --> 00:06.200
Meet Ichido, your private speaking room for Mac.

00:06.600 --> 00:10.000
Import a clip, or capture audio straight from your Mac.

00:10.150 --> 00:12.900
Listen to the audio with transcriptions.

00:13.200 --> 00:14.500
Understand.

00:14.700 --> 00:18.500
Explore meanings, grammar, and translations right in the app.

00:18.650 --> 00:20.300
Then repeat.

00:20.500 --> 00:22.300
Record your own version.

00:22.450 --> 00:27.400
Compare your pitch, timing, and loudness directly against the reference.

00:27.550 --> 00:35.900
When your words match reliably, Ichido gives you measured targets, showing you exactly what to adjust next.

00:36.000 --> 00:38.200
Try one more take.

00:38.400 --> 00:40.600
You can record your own free speaking too.

00:40.750 --> 00:43.800
Just click any word to replay that exact moment.

00:44.000 --> 00:47.200
No accounts, no uploads, no tracking.

00:47.500 --> 00:51.000
And all of this with total privacy.

00:51.250 --> 00:56.600
Your voice, transcripts, and analysis stay completely offline, right where they belong.

00:56.750 --> 00:60.800
Ichido, available for free in early access.

00:61.000 --> 00:63.000
Give it one more try.
